00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:50.890
focused, Mark Martin's mission to chase a championship was temporarily derailed in

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:57.260
Darlington. For this team, broken parts met broken hearts as they continue to

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.570
chase this elusive rainbow.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:05.710
